# Per-node Drive targets. Copy to .drive-map.local at the ROOT of your brain
# (beside spaces/), gitignored, and edit.
# Format: <node path>|<absolute target on THIS machine>
#
# The node path is relative to spaces/ — 'guitar', not 'spaces/guitar'. That is also how
# the convention root maps, so Drive never mirrors the repo's own container folder.
#
# Nodes listed here ignore the convention root entirely — point them at a pre-existing
# folder, a separately-shared folder, or a different Google account.
#
# guitar|/path/to/cloud-storage/Guitar
# projects/demo|/path/to/cloud-storage/Demo
